WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.960
- They are finally here,
the Apple Air Tags.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.630
These have been rumored
for years at this point.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.380
I feel like every time
there's an Apple event,

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.190
we think that they are gonna be announced,

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:12.750
and they haven't been,
but they're finally here.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.410
We've got them in the studio to test out.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:18.540
I'm so excited about this
because I lose a lot of stuff.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.100
I'm not happy about it, but
it's just who I am as a person.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.262
And that's just, I've accepted that.

00:00:26.262 --> 00:00:29.790
(gentle melodic music)

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.760
They've got two different
variations right now

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.030
that you can purchase on the website.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:37.473
You can get the one pack for
$29 or the four pack for 99.

00:00:37.473 --> 00:00:38.306
And what's really cool about these

00:00:38.306 --> 00:00:41.600
is they are fully customizable
with emojis or text.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.800
So you are able to do that
when you purchase them.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.040
We've also got some accessories.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:48.060
We've got a loop, a leather
loop, and a leather key ring.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.960
Let's open these up, set them
up, and let's chat about it.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.740
Here's the box.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.423
It is a tiny little package.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.920
Oh wow.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.770
Oh man, this is so exciting

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.010
because it's been a while
since there has been

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.200
sort of a new product category for Apple,

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.043
and this is an all new product.

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:14.587
