00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:33.020
It does have a replaceable battery.

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.970
This should last you up to a year.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:36.540
And the battery is just one of those

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.920
CR2032 coin cell batteries.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:39.820
So it should be pretty easy

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:41.910
just to replace the battery after a year.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.770
