and I'm always needing one.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.510
So not only will I be able to find my keys

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:26.600
but I'll always be able to
find a SIM card ejector.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.070
Oh, this is very nice.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.480
Look at that.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:35.300
So it looks like this also has
a little snap, just like so.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.173
